a</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">thanks for the clarification!</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">abdou8754#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,13:03:50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b.lina</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">no idea, chfit bsah hder 3liha medkour so it's a must ig</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">mimi.i0844#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,13:50:33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yes a company can ''mat9blsh'' b convention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,15:12:59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">nesrineabdelhak</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">hmm
why</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,15:31:23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Par exemple, te3 Algérie Télécom ki roht 3endhom galoli on ne signe meme pas la première feuille hta nchofo la convention, gatli 9ader capable tkoun kayna une condition a propos du recrutement wela l'assurance, qu'on est pas confortable à accepter</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,15:37:03</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ikram_farez</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bruh what company does accept without even checking terms and conditions ? 💀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,15:37:58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_larbi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Startups 👁️👄👁️</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ikram_farez#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,15:48:29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ikram_farez</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The emoji 😭😂</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_larbi#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-08-19,16:14:56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.mar1one</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hya the more logic is can a company t9blk without a convention because how can a company accept without seeing th