06:53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">meriemmebarekmansouri</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">&lt;@&amp;877880553599303711&gt; Khasna channels f study space, srtt NLP</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-18,18:10:01</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_larbi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Phonetics is the sounds of the words( how you prounonce it), phonology is the sound( eg: can I have the pen (↘️), please(↗️) )</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">meriemmebarekmansouri#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-18,18:12:04</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">meriemmebarekmansouri</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sma phonology is the intonation? (wla i don't remember how we used to call it)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_larbi#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-18,18:19:22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.mar1one</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Phonology is the science of phonetics</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-18,18:19:26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.mar1one</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">That's how I understood it</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-18,18:20:09</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">meriemmebarekmansouri</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</