Concerning PFE:
- ida u have a topic you want to work on, you can suggest to a teacher, if the teacher agrees that you work on it, bsahtk
- Ranking is considered if a teacher is overwhelmed only, sma u can have your topic and negotiate with the teacher to supervise you 
- Out of Algeria: Simply NO, aslan internship that were abraod online are illegal (ghamdna 3ynina)
- Foreign univ li dayrin m3ahom conv: theoritically we can work with them, practically hasb l ministry
- Anything inside algeria should be fine
- ida topic ta3 lécole, main supervisor lzm m school, else main supervisor mn whoever u are working with, w lzm a co-supervisor m l'école
