="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">We asked for a solution to all the serious problems, and we added ipads, n3awedou hadra ?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-22,21:54:54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">And by we, i mean ceux qui vont signer</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-22,21:55:26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_larbi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">En gros, koul paper on la signe wehedha yak ?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-22,21:55:51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Good question, khos &lt;@882774339051737109&gt;</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.sanssoucis#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-23,00:29:14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">mimi.i0844</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">المنطق يقول ايه كيعاد كاينة ورقة تاعنا برك و ورقة تاع لي برومو كامل (مازال ماقريتش وش فيهم لداخل</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_larbi#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-23,00:51:33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">frog3526</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">kima derna f la greve ta3 2nd year, paper for term -&gt; semester, and paper for eliminatory note</Data></Cell><Cell><D