We are waiting for the right moment to inform everyone!</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-25,17:03:22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">It does not make sense... Ida nhoto les papiers w Les signatures, on dois attendre une décision men 3endhom, ida ya3touna solution sans grève, y'aura pas de grève, non? Wela manich fahem nichen?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-25,17:05:04</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.sanssoucis</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yep ida madolna solution fi interval of time T, yes marahch tkon grève. We planned everything dw!</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">moonfuji#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-10-25,17:10:58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">raoufbendi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">الحكومة حسام</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.sanssoucis#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
